==English==

===Verb===
{{en-verb|head=[[tip]] [[off]]|tips off|tipping off|tipped off}}

# {{context|idiomatic|transitive|lang=en}} To [[alert]] or [[inform]] someone, especially [[confidentially]].
#: ''An anonymous caller '''tipped off''' the police that the suspect would be in the area.''
# {{context|basketball|lang=en}} To put the ball in play by throwing it up between two opponents.
# {{context|transitive|obsolete|lang=en}} To [[pour out]] (liquor).

